<code>assert index >= 0 && index <= \old(this.size()) => \forall int i; index <= i && i < \old(this.size()); (this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i-1))) || (this.get(i) == null && \old(this.get(i-1)) == null));</code>

This assertion ensures that for every valid index `i` from the insertion point to the previous size of the vector, the element at position `i` in the updated vector is either equal to the old element at position `i-1` or both are `null`. This reflects the shift of elements upwards due to the insertion.
--------------------
